libhsts
------------------------------------------
The HSTS preload list is a list of domains that support HTTPS. The list is
compiled by Google and is utilised by Chrome, Firefox and others.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libhsts-devel-0.1.0-1bl2
  libhsts0-0.1.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  autoconf-archive-2026.11.11-1
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.26-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.com/rockdaboot/libhsts

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.com/rockdaboot/libhsts/-/archive/libhsts-0.1.0/libhsts-libhsts-0.1.0.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libhsts-0.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libhsts-0.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libhsts-0.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhsts-0.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhsts0-0.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhsts-devel-0.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libhsts)
  /usr/bin/hsts.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libhsts.README
  /usr/share/doc/libhsts/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libhsts/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libhsts/LICENSE.chromium
  /usr/share/doc/libhsts/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libhsts/README.md

(libhsts0)
  /usr/bin/cyghsts-0.dll

(libhsts-devel)
  /usr/include/libhsts.h
  /usr/lib/libhsts.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libhsts.pc

